            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Mmm... Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160421"
            ]
          },
          "750160421": {
            "id": "750160421",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Of course we have! We've feasted a ton in our time together, haven't we, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160422"
            ]
          },
          "750160422": {
            "id": "750160422",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hey, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, don't go wandering off!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160423"
            ]
          },
          "750160423": {
            "id": "750160423",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "Shame. He's such a vigorous little one too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160424"
            ]
          },
          "750160424": {
            "id": "750160424",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, what's the danger exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160425"
            ]
          },
          "750160425": {
            "id": "750160425",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Mind your tone, would you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160426"
            ]
          },
          "750160426": {
            "id": "750160426",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "My apologies. Eloquence is not my strong suit... But I really do think it is a shame.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160427"
            ]
          },
          "750160427": {
            "id": "750160427",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "#Alright. I'll be forthright. You must have seen many little Tepetlisaurs before, yes? {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} is different from them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160428"
            ]
          },
          "750160428": {
            "id": "750160428",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yeah, he has a beautiful ribbon on his tail!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160429"
            ]
          },
          "750160429": {
            "id": "750160429",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "Haha, that was your doing, no? But that's not what I'm talking about — rather, I speak of the mark on his horn.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160430"
            ]
          },
          "750160430": {
            "id": "750160430",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You mean the red mark on his horn?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160431"
            ]
          },
          "750160431": {
            "id": "750160431",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "That is not a mark that an ordinary Saurian would bear. In truth, records indicate this to be the \"Flame{RUBY#[D]Xiuhcoatl}lord's Blessing.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160432"
            ]
          },
          "750160432": {
            "id": "750160432",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "How to put it... Saurians with this mark often possess incredible power, such as greater strength than other Saurians, swifter swimming speed, or being able to leap to greater heights.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160433"
            ]
          },
          "750160433": {
            "id": "750160433",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That sounds like a perk to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160434"
            ]
          },
          "750160434": {
            "id": "750160434",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "But as I said before, this is a blessing from the Flamelord, and not their own power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160435"
            ]
          },
          "750160435": {
            "id": "750160435",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "This is the power of the far more ancient dragons, and Natlan's Saurians can no longer withstand it today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160436"
            ]
          },
          "750160436": {
            "id": "750160436",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "The Wayob and the Night Kingdom also reject this power, and as such, refuse to accept such Saurians.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160437"
            ]
          },
          "750160437": {
            "id": "750160437",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "And in the process of growing, they will sometimes be killed by this power, or driven mad by it... Both dangerous possibilities.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160438"
            ]
          },
          "750160438": {
            "id": "750160438",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "Perhaps, I believe, you should deliver him to the Children of Echoes. They will deal with the matter appropriately.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160439"
            ]
          },
          "750160439": {
            "id": "750160439",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"Deal with the matter\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160440"
            ]
          },
          "750160440": {
            "id": "750160440",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That phrasing is ice-cold.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160441"
            ]
          },
          "750160441": {
            "id": "750160441",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "Again, apologies for my clumsy words. But I believe it best to leave this to us locals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160442"
            ]
          },
          "750160442": {
            "id": "750160442",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...Thanks for letting me know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160443"
            ]
          },
          "750160443": {
            "id": "750160443",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "But you do not intend to give up on him, I presume?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160444"
            ]
          },
          "750160444": {
            "id": "750160444",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Giving up should never be the first resort.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160445"
            ]
          },
          "750160445": {
            "id": "750160445",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I do not abandon my companions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160446"
            ]
          },
          "750160446": {
            "id": "750160446",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "...*sigh* Alright. Very well, outlander. Your resolve is evident.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160447"
            ]
          },
          "750160447": {
            "id": "750160447",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "I do not know if I should reveal this to you, for this is a secret that only we locals know...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160448"
            ]
          },
          "750160448": {
            "id": "750160448",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "#...But if you wish to save {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, you must take him on a pilgrimage to the volcano.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160449"
            ]
          },
          "750160449": {
            "id": "750160449",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "Legend has it that our tribal warriors would carry a token that was split in two, and in the great volcano they would wash the name of their companion as remembered by the Fallen {RUBY#[D]Xiuhcoatl}Dragon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160450"
            ]
          },
          "750160450": {
            "id": "750160450",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "Then, they would gain their Saurian the Night Kingdom's acceptance once more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160451"
            ]
          },
          "750160451": {
            "id": "750160451",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why are you telling me this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160452"
            ]
          },
          "750160452": {
            "id": "750160452",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "Because the people of the six great tribes no longer attempt this, nor have they the time to spare for such an attempt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160453"
            ]
          },
          "750160453": {
            "id": "750160453",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "But you are an outlander, a traveler from afar, unbound by the old-fashioned ideas the tribes hold.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160454"
            ]
          },
          "750160454": {
            "id": "750160454",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "And if you succeed, you will prove beyond doubt that the inscriptions on some ancient relics and crumbling scrolls remain true to this day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160455"
            ]
          },
          "750160455": {
            "id": "750160455",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "This is of utmost importance to me... so if you would like to try, I will help you find that token.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160456"
            ]
          },
          "750160456": {
            "id": "750160456",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "And as for you, you will be able to save your companion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160457"
            ]
          },
          "750160457": {
            "id": "750160457",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sounds like a win-win.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160458"
            ]
          },
          "750160458": {
            "id": "750160458",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's worth a shot...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160459"
            ]
          },
          "750160459": {
            "id": "750160459",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "In that case, I shall let you know if I find the place. Alternatively, you could come find me. My research will take me near the Children of Echoes for the time being...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160460"
            ]
          },
          "750160460": {
            "id": "750160460",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Manqu",
            "text": "Until we meet again, then, friend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160461"
            ]
          },
          "750160461": {
            "id": "750160461",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "The Saurian Relics Association member, Manqu, departs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160462"
            ]
          },
          "750160462": {
            "id": "750160462",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hey, hey! {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}! Quit running around already!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160463"
            ]
          },
          "750160463": {
            "id": "750160463",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Umm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160464"
            ]
          },
          "750160464": {
            "id": "750160464",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Oh, and by the way, {NICKNAME}, is that guy gone? He didn't say anything weird, did he?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160465"
            ]
          },
          "750160465": {
            "id": "750160465",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Long story short...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160466"
            ]
          },
          "750160466": {
            "id": "750160466",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hmm... In other words, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} is sick, and we need to grab some stuff and take him up the volcano to get that illness cured...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160467"
            ]
          },
          "750160467": {
            "id": "750160467",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160468"
            ]
          },
          "750160468": {
            "id": "750160468",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*sigh* Not that he seems to understand anything that's going on, of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160469"
            ]
          },
          "750160469": {
            "id": "750160469",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Not that it matters. Maybe we'll solve all the problems before he gets big. That way, there'll be nothing standing between him and growing up healthy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160470"
            ]
          },
          "750160470": {
            "id": "750160470",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Now, we can't be sure if we can rely on that guy... But if it's a token we need, we can look around too, can't we? Who knows, we might find it even faster!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160471"
            ]
          },
          "750160471": {
            "id": "750160471",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160472"
            ]
          },
          "750160472": {
            "id": "750160472",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160473"
            ]
          },
          "750160473": {
            "id": "750160473",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You come along too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160474"
            ]
          },
          "750160474": {
            "id": "750160474",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7501699",
